<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.7300 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Aug 15		  Aug 14</p>
<p> High			     75.8000		 75.7505</p>
<p> Low				75.7800		 75.7000</p>
<p> Open			     75.7800		 75.7505</p>
<p> Close			    75.8000		 75.7300</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    4.410		   4.185</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509 410</p>
</text>
